## 1. Executive Summary <a name="executive-summary"></a>

**LexNet** transforms the existing NyayaSahaya legal assistant into a **secure, networked, hardware-anchored legal intelligence platform**. It bridges Computer Science (AI, RAG, distributed systems) and Electronics (secure hardware nodes, biometric authentication, embedded systems) into a single cohesive product that addresses a real, unsolved problem — **trusted digital legal document infrastructure for India**.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This project directly builds on your 3rd-semester NyayaSahaya project. Your existing RAG chatbot ([app.py](file:///e:/NyayaSahaya/NyayaSahaya-bot/app.py)), document generator ([doc_generator.py](file:///e:/NyayaSahaya/legal_document_generator/doc_generator.py)), and summarizer form the **Legal AI Engine** — the core intelligence layer of LexNet.

