### Data Flow: How a Document Moves Through LexNet

```
User Request → TLN Auth (fingerprint/smartcard)
    → AI Layer (generate/summarize/analyze)
        → Network Layer (metadata + hash + version)
            → TLN Signing (hardware crypto signature)
                → Hash Registry (tamper-proof record)
                    → Counterparty Notification
```

