### Layer 1: Legal AI Engine (Your Existing Code, Enhanced)

#### a) RAG Legal Assistant (Extended from [app.py](file:///e:/NyayaSahaya/NyayaSahaya-bot/app.py))

**Current capability:**
```python
# Your existing ConversationalRetrievalChain
qa = ConversationalRetrievalChain.from_llm(
    llm=llm,
    retriever=db_retriever,
    memory=memory,
    combine_docs_chain_kwargs={"prompt": legal_prompt},
