### 🟢 ECE Student 1 — Secure Hardware Node Lead

**Primary Responsibility:** Design and build the physical TLN device

| Deliverable | Description |
|-------------|-------------|
| TLN Hardware Design | Circuit schematic + PCB layout for all components |
| Secure Element Integration | ATECC608A setup, key provisioning, ECDSA signing |
| RTC Module | DS3231 integration for tamper-proof timestamps |
| Enclosure Design | 3D-printed case with proper ventilation and component access |
| Power Management | USB-C power delivery, UPS backup consideration |
| Hardware Audit Logger | Append-only log storage on encrypted partition |

**Key Technologies:** Raspberry Pi, ATECC608A (I2C), DS3231, KiCad (schematic), FreeCAD/Fusion360 (enclosure)

---

### 🟡 ECE Student 2 — Biometric & Embedded Firmware Lead

**Primary Responsibility:** Implement biometric authentication and embedded firmware

| Deliverable | Description |
|-------------|-------------|
| Fingerprint Module | R307 sensor integration — enrollment, matching, template storage |
| RFID/NFC Reader | RC522 integration for smart card authentication |
| Camera Module | Pi Camera v3 — document scanning + OCR pipeline |
| OLED Display | SSD1306 — status display, verification results, QR codes |
| LED Status System | WS2812B — visual feedback for authentication states |
| Embedded Firmware | Python/C service running on RPi — orchestrating all hardware |

**Key Technologies:** Python (RPi.GPIO, smbus2, pyfingerprint), Tesseract OCR, OpenCV

