## 11. Research Contributions <a name="research-contributions"></a>

### Why This Project is Research-Grade

| Aspect | Research Contribution |
|--------|----------------------|
| **Legal NLP** | Domain-specific RAG with InLegalBERT for Indian legal corpus — clause-level analysis goes beyond simple summarization |
| **Hardware-Anchored Trust** | Using TPM-class secure elements (ATECC608A) for legal document signing is a novel application in the Indian legal tech space |
| **Compliance Automation** | Automated DPDP Act compliance checking for legal documents — no existing tool does this comprehensively |
| **Biometric + Crypto Fusion** | Combining biometric authentication with hardware cryptographic signing creates a multi-factor trust model |
| **Distributed Legal Network** | Document metadata network with hardware-signed integrity proofs — a step toward standardized legal document infrastructure |

### Potential Paper Titles

1. *"LexNet: A Hardware-Anchored Intelligent Network for Trusted Legal Document Operations"*
2. *"Integrating Biometric Authentication with Cryptographic Hardware for Secure Legal Document Signing"*
3. *"Domain-Specific RAG with Compliance-Aware Analysis for Indian Legal Documents"*

