| 2 | MicroSD Card | SanDisk 64GB Class 10 | — | 1 | ₹600 | ₹600 |
| 3 | Fingerprint Sensor | R307 Optical | UART | 1 | ₹1,200 | ₹1,200 |
| 4 | RFID/NFC Reader | RC522 MFRC522 | SPI | 1 | ₹150 | ₹150 |
| 5 | RFID Cards/Tags | MIFARE Classic 1K | — | 5 | ₹30 | ₹150 |
| 6 | Secure Element | ATECC608A Breakout | I2C | 1 | ₹800 | ₹800 |
| 7 | Real-Time Clock | DS3231 Module | I2C | 1 | ₹250 | ₹250 |
| 8 | Camera Module | Raspberry Pi Camera v3 | CSI | 1 | ₹2,800 | ₹2,800 |
| 9 | OLED Display | 0.96" SSD1306 128×64 | I2C | 1 | ₹200 | ₹200 |
| 10 | LED Strip | WS2812B (10 LEDs) | GPIO | 1 | ₹150 | ₹150 |
| 11 | USB-C Power Supply | Official RPi 5V/3A | — | 1 | ₹500 | ₹500 |
| 12 | Breadboard + Jumpers | — | — | 1 | ₹200 | ₹200 |
| 13 | Enclosure | 3D Printed ABS | — | 1 | ₹500 | ₹500 |
| 14 | Miscellaneous | Wires, screws, standoffs | — | — | ₹300 | ₹300 |

### Cost Summary

| Item | Cost |
|------|------|
| **Hardware (Single TLN)** | **₹14,300** |
| Software (Open Source Stack) | ₹0 |
| Cloud Hosting (Development) | ₹0 (localhost) |
| 3D Printing (if outsourced) | ~₹500 |
| **Total Project Cost** | **~₹15,000** |

> [!TIP]
> **Budget-friendly alternative:** If the ATECC608A is hard to source, use software-based ECDSA with Python's `cryptography` library as a prototype, and document that production systems should use hardware secure elements. This reduces the cost by ₹800 and still demonstrates the concept.

